Diagnostic tests for the CSF/SD implementation (see test/csf_sd).

Tests here are expected to FAIL until a known bug is fixed. Their checkfiles
are generated with MOLCAS_CI_VERIFY=NO (the energies do not depend on the
checks), after which the >export line is switched back to EPQ or YES. Once a
test passes, move it to test/csf_sd. This directory has no .csf_sd file, so
'pymolcas verify .csf_sd' does not include it.
